[node name="Notes" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Boards/Settings/Holder/Extra/Note2/ScrollContainer" unique_id=848294390]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_styles/normal = SubResource("StyleBoxFlat_qt3dg")
theme_override_styles/focus = SubResource("StyleBoxFlat_qt3dg")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Items:[/b][ul]
Link Item: When pasting the link of an image, it will try to display it
Board: Every board can have the same name but different ID, Each item placed inside of the board will be linked to the board's ID
Upload File: when selecting a file, it will try to display it's contents within the preview window, at a maximum of 100 lines. If the selected file is an image, it will try and display that image
[/ul]
[b]Misc:[/b][ul]
Holding RMB (Right mouse button) allows you to pan through the space, also works with middle mouse button and it captures your mouse in the process so moving isn't limited to your window (pretty lit if you ask me)
The settings page uses the same Board system, all it does it change an already existing board within the program, Literally recycle, reuse, reduce or whatever
[/ul]
[b]Information Collected/Stored:[/b][ul]
only the items dragged and dropped, history and background color is stored into Save, removeHistory and settings files, respectively, basically anything you can physically see within the program
Files are not stored, only the directory leading to them and contents are turned into text and displayed within
[/ul]
[b]Third Party use:[/b][ul]
Icons used: [color=green][b][url]https://icons8.com[/url][/b][/color]
Font: [color=green][b][url]https://www.programmingfonts.org/#oxproto[/url][/b][/color]
Url preview API: [color=green][b][url]https://docs.linkpreview.net/[/url][/b][/color]
😎No AI used (it's pretty obvious if you look at how badly written the code is)
[/ul]
[code]
The github repository will always have the latest updates and fixes than the releases (this is easier than exporting and continously uploading the export)"

